<VehRentLocInfo Type="10">
<SubSection>
<Paragraph>
<Text>1. Meet us at Daly City Station:
 
Our driver will meet you in at the curb of the Daly City station, 500 John Daly Boulevard, Daly City. Track their location using the Kyte app. You will need to take a 15-20 minute train ride (public transit fees apply). This saves time and avoids the airport rental counters.
 
2. Schedule your pickup for at least 60 minutes after landing:
 
If you land at 3:30, schedule your pickup for 4:30. For international flights and/or checked baggage, allow a total buffer of 90-120 minutes.
 
3. Full meeting instructions and booking edits:
 
Check your email or the Kyte app for detailed handover instructions after booking. If your flight is delayed, please update your scheduled delivery time in the Kyte app or contact customer support.</Text>
</Paragraph>
</SubSection>
</VehRentLocInfo>
